aco)"],"3797775":["The Coronation of the Virgin is a 1414 tempera-on-panel polyptych by the Italian late Gothic artist Lorenzo Monaco, centred on the subject of the Coronation of the Virgin. Once in the Camaldolese monastery of Santa Maria degli Angeli, it is now housed in the Uffizi Gallery in Florence.","Coronation of the Virgin (Lorenzo Monaco)"]},"titlesFrom":["fr","P1476","alias:en","alias:fr","aliasFilter:1"]}